          <groundspeak:finder id="181446">DanOCan</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP570 Eckville [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for a drive to look at some grain elevators and decided to detour to Eckville, a town I had never visited before.  Cap was easy to find as it was in the bottom of a depression and is well marked with a stake and flagging.  Only needed a little dusting of dirt and debris with my foot before it was ready to get a photo.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
